{"type":"standard","title":"Kathy Castor","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Kathy Castor</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q458492","titles":{"canonical":"Kathy_Castor","normalized":"Kathy Castor","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Kathy Castor</span></span>"},"pageid":5508806,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Kathy_Castor.jpg/330px-Kathy_Castor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":496},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Kathy_Castor.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1278,"height":1920},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1373057939","tid":"54a2ef19-a7d6-11f1-89e8-984a70dd5b4f","timestamp":"2026-09-03T20:30:41Z","description":"American lawyer & politician (born 1966)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathy_Castor","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathy_Castor?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathy_Castor?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Kathy_Castor"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathy_Castor","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Kathy_Castor","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathy_Castor?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Kathy_Castor"}},"extract":"Katherine Anne Castor is an American politician and lawyer serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 14th congressional district since 2007. The district, based in Tampa, was numbered as the 11th district from 2007 to 2013. A member of the Democratic Party, she previously served on the Hillsborough County Commission from 2002 to 2006.","extract_html":"<p><b>Katherine Anne Castor</b> is an American politician and lawyer serving as the U.S. representative for Florida's 14th congressional district since 2007. The district, based in Tampa, was numbered as the 11th district from 2007 to 2013. A member of the Democratic Party, she previously served on the Hillsborough County Commission from 2002 to 2006.</p>"}